---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: releaseVestedTokens(investor)
    q_check_vesting --> q_check_maturity: investorPosition[investor].vestingAddress != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_no_vesting: no vesting contract
    q_check_maturity --> q_check_balance: block.timestamp >= vestingReleaseDate
    q_check_maturity --> q_revert_premature: vesting not matured
    q_check_balance --> q_release: vestedBalance > 0
    q_check_balance --> q_revert_zero: zero vested balance
    q_release --> q_emit: vestingContract.release(investor)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit VestedTokensReleased(investor, vestingContract, amount)
    q_revert_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract
    q_revert_premature --> [*]: revert VestingNotMatured
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert ZeroVestedBalance

    note right of q_release
        INV-001: released tokens transfer from vesting contract to investor
        INV-002: vested amount follows configured schedule
        INV-003: total released <= total locked in vesting contract
    end note
